stateDiagram-v2
 state 洽谈 {
   NEGOTIATING --> AWAITING_CONFIRMATION
   AWAITING_CONFIRMATION --> NEGOTIATING : 修改条件，保留旧版
   AWAITING_CONFIRMATION --> AGREED : 双方确认同一版
 }
 AGREED --> CONFIRMED : 创建订单与档期占用
 CONFIRMED --> AWAITING_COMPLETION : 一方确认完成
 AWAITING_COMPLETION --> COMPLETED : 另一方确认完成
 CONFIRMED --> CANCELLATION_REQUESTED
 CANCELLATION_REQUESTED --> CANCELLED : 同意或裁定取消
 CANCELLATION_REQUESTED --> DISPUTED : 不同意
 CONFIRMED --> DISPUTED
 AWAITING_COMPLETION --> DISPUTED
 DISPUTED --> CANCELLED : 记录处理结果
 DISPUTED --> COMPLETED : 确认演出已完成
